<h1 id="toc7"><span><span class="hilighter">FURTHER CONFIGURATION</span></span></h1>
</div>
<hr />
<p>To disable the scanline filter, add the following patch:</p>
<div class="blockquote" style="font-family: 'profontwindowsregular', monospace;">
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[module&#32;CSS]]</span><br />
div#extrac-div-1, div#extrac-div-2 {<br />
display: none;<br />
}<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[/module]]</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p>While the theme is intended to be use as is, it is possible to change the colors by putting the following after the <tt>[[include]]</tt>:</p>
<div class="blockquote" style="font-family: 'profontwindowsregular', monospace;">
<p>:root {<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;--accentColor:&#32;246,196,3;</span><br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;--darkColor:&#32;40,26,8;</span><br />
}</p>
</div>
<p><tt><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">--accentColor</span></tt> controls the primary accent (yellow by default).<br />
<tt><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">--darkColor</span></tt> controls the background and dark shade in the theme.<br />
Change them to your desired colors in the RGB format.</p>
<p><tt>Recommend not using pure black for your background.</tt></p>
</div>
